Package: cyclisticmonitor
Title: Cyclistic Programme Monitor
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Portfolio", "Project", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reproducible R pipeline, SQL-backed indicator tables, and Shiny
